# Replaces Semgrep's built-in defaults (which skip tests/ and test files). Only generated, vendored or
# third-party trees are ignored; tests are scanned like product code. docs/ holds frozen research scripts
# (evidence, not product code); cases/ holds case-family data (no code), and cases/hidden/ must never be
# read by a gate (D-014). Lifted from TechnoMile .semgrepignore (ATTRIBUTIONS.md).
.git/
.venv/
.tools/
.gates/
node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/
tools/envs/*/.venv/
docs/
cases/
